[{"client_msg_id":"975159EC-C162-4806-BE64-63A458A77C73","type":"message","user":"U843L486L","text":"あれっ？\nミルフィーユは豚と白菜と大根の三層がデファクトだと思ってました。","ts":"1636466820.046400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GtjG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bb983161-1747-4578-b4f5-67b6a0640cad","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"ふろふき大根もいいぞ","ts":"1636465962.044700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"subara","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i3=aj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0c06b99d-fb40-4495-8a38-7e2915f9a9b9","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"大根、品種改良でしっかりしてるけど繊維質すぎないのがいいですよね\nスライスしてもしっかりしてるし、だけどスジは強くない","ts":"1636465603.044300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dtrB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5B55A824-02CB-46A5-B2A0-35853A9A0C26","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"ぶり大根はいいぞ:muscle:","ts":"1636465436.043500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"60X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"637209b7-19bc-475b-afad-84bc7ddc7764","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"\u003chttps://www.kurashiru.com/recipes/b0dcfbc4-c8b3-4be3-985b-40df45275191\u003e","ts":"1636465372.042900","attachments":[{"fallback":"クラシル: 豚バラと大根のミルフィーユ鍋 作り方・レシピ | クラシル","id":1,"title":"豚バラと大根のミルフィーユ鍋 作り方・レシピ | クラシル","title_link":"https://www.kurashiru.com/recipes/b0dcfbc4-c8b3-4be3-985b-40df45275191","text":"「豚バラと大根のミルフィーユ鍋」の作り方を簡単で分かりやすい料理レシピ動画で紹介しています。白菜で作るのが主流のミルフィーユ鍋ですが、大根で作ってもとても美味しい鍋に仕上がり、おすすめです。今回はさっぱりポン酢味にしました。柔らかく味の染みた大根と豚バラ肉の相性はばっちり！見た目も華やかなので、蓋を開けた瞬間のインパクトも大ですよ。","image_url":"https://video.kurashiru.com/production/videos/b0dcfbc4-c8b3-4be3-985b-40df45275191/compressed_thumbnail_square_large.jpg?1611912076","blocks":null,"service_name":"クラシル","from_url":"https://www.kurashiru.com/recipes/b0dcfbc4-c8b3-4be3-985b-40df45275191","original_url":"https://www.kurashiru.com/recipes/b0dcfbc4-c8b3-4be3-985b-40df45275191"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g4k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b9ccaa40-cb9f-47d3-96e1-f53524bea95e","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"\u003chttps://bazurecipe.com/2020/05/16/%E7%84%A1%E6%B0%B4%E5%8D%83%E5%88%87%E3%82%8A%E5%A4%A7%E6%A0%B9%E9%8D%8B/\u003e","ts":"1636465308.042600","attachments":[{"fallback":"料理研究家リュウジのバズレシピ.com: 無水千切り大根鍋 | 料理研究家リュウジのバズレシピ.com","id":1,"title":"無水千切り大根鍋 | 料理研究家リュウジのバズレシピ.com","title_link":"https://bazurecipe.com/2020/05/16/%E7%84%A1%E6%B0%B4%E5%8D%83%E5%88%87%E3%82%8A%E5%A4%A7%E6%A0%B9%E9%8D%8B/","text":"大根が安くて旨い時期に絶対やってほしい最高の鍋ができました！ 【無水千切り大根鍋】 ダシの染みたホクホクの大根を豚バラで巻けばもうそこは楽園です レシピはこちら！ 【材料】 ・大根（千切り）…300g ・ショウガ（千切り）…10g ・豚バラ薄切り肉…200g ・A［白だし…大さじ1と1／2　ゴマ油…大さじ1と1／2、酒…大さじ5］ ・万能ネギ、いりゴマ…各適量 ・塩、ポン酢（好みで）…各適量 【作","thumb_url":"https://bazurecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/EP-vyk_VAAAV8ca.jpg","blocks":null,"ts":1589639711,"service_name":"料理研究家リュウジのバズレシピ.com","service_icon":"https://bazurecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/cropped-09e206f5750b6541346a7f1bf563bbe7-180x180.jpg","thumb_width":680,"thumb_height":383,"from_url":"https://bazurecipe.com/2020/05/16/%E7%84%A1%E6%B0%B4%E5%8D%83%E5%88%87%E3%82%8A%E5%A4%A7%E6%A0%B9%E9%8D%8B/","original_url":"https://bazurecipe.com/2020/05/16/%E7%84%A1%E6%B0%B4%E5%8D%83%E5%88%87%E3%82%8A%E5%A4%A7%E6%A0%B9%E9%8D%8B/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NWOYM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8ce60b34-52c1-4f71-8ce7-05eb1ae39bb3","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あとおでんの具は強いかな....寒ブリと合せてブリ大根?","ts":"1636464706.042000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"subara","count":4,"users":["U022XK5866Q","UD1FQV38V","U9S4G0LJW","U01D9BALEKU"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aI4F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6955d859-1f8c-4bfc-bffa-38a334418af9","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"我が家は圧力鍋で蒸すのが定番","ts":"1636464662.041400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H8J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"16e77775-df1f-4566-860b-2fa1480da20f","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"あと、蒸し器があれば、酢味噌で頂くと瞬殺します","ts":"1636464645.041100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d8ej"}]},{"client_msg_id":"46bf4dd2-708b-4731-8525-99d086218c40","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ああ、いいですねえ","ts":"1636464611.040700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ztR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3c1e79c8-188d-4ccf-8501-0538bb3c4d87","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"味噌汁に入れるのが好き","ts":"1636464575.040400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U01D9BALEKU"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9t7Q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"679c9054-5cb2-4ac5-8c0c-c0399d8dafc1","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"普通にサラダに使いまくるというのもある(スライサーで)","ts":"1636464501.040100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rpZL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7da2e5f7-e7df-4add-885b-56226a4e3796","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あとは浅漬けにしてもいいだろうし、もみじおろしにして鍋の友とか?","ts":"1636464482.039700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ucj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e87b31fa-95d1-49f5-8cd7-90782f6bdc60","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"切干し大根好きだけど確かに消費という意味では向いてなさそう","ts":"1636464440.039200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X/zyD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4717c2fa-1db5-4ce4-a63a-bb5a77aa4d8c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"みぞれ鍋が消費にはいいかな","ts":"1636464403.038500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U022XK5866Q","U011FTGJ3SN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"26u/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c3fe1c18-0504-494e-8467-e8f71ab93f65","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"切干しは最終手段かな...","ts":"1636464386.038200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3qT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1769f0d6-0b08-47f6-9ab6-0cad5bf55950","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"実家から大根きたので何かしたい","ts":"1636464084.037900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LqzM3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"38ACD4C2-FFDB-4407-A071-573D8686433E","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"あとは、子供がいる場合だと、柔らかさの調整も簡単というのもありますね（長めに茹でれば柔らかくなる）","ts":"1636462074.036800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5Ne0r"}]},{"client_msg_id":"F4CD121C-20AC-4C44-9DDA-727A3A894A47","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"炒める前にお湯に塩と油を入れて下茹ですると、\n\n1. 野菜自体の水気が飛ぶ\n2. 下味がつくので美味くなる\n3. 炒める時間が短縮される\n\nという効果が得られるので、たいへんオススメです。","ts":"1636461952.035400","edited":{"user":"UFHQ7TNT0","ts":"1636461979.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tips","count":1,"users":["UBNPMJJGM"]},{"name":"tiken","count":1,"users":["U01D9BALEKU"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LMSl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"65f0d852-23ee-4edf-bf21-5b3ef816321f","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"痛めるのは得意(真面目に管理しろ)","ts":"1636461893.033600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U81LLJ340"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z=A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9572f3b6-e50d-4b57-beba-224400fe38bf","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"キャベツ、いためるのけっこうレベルを要求されるのかもなあ","ts":"1636461867.032600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u=oA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"47dec707-d6be-4dd8-8528-558cab59bc8d","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"キャベツのステーキはたまにします。生で食べられるんだからあんまり気にすんなの精神で。","ts":"1636461696.031200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sP8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e400e71d-9b45-49da-943b-508396559272","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"(単に時短狙い)","ts":"1636461691.031000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E5dx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9923aa81-6d9f-4591-941f-2422a9b44124","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"ニンジンなら軽くレンチンはたまにするな","ts":"1636461672.030400","edited":{"user":"U022XK5866Q","ts":"1636461725.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U81LLJ340"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xwWa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2757ED6A-C87E-4DF4-8DCA-7A982B19678D","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"ニンジンとかも軽く茹でてから炒めます","ts":"1636461593.029700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":2,"users":["U022XK5866Q","U01D9BALEKU"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9/iYA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"96E33787-1D02-40A6-BA40-B3DD23576A73","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"なるほど。僕はキャベツを炒める時は、1〜2分くらい塩ゆでしちゃいますね。ザルにあげて水を切ってフライパンに戻します。いわゆる中華炒めスタイルです。\nなので、フライパンのキャベツは、炒めるというよりは、残った水気を飛ばすくらいな感じになります。","ts":"1636461548.029100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kOR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5ad3bd96-f654-4634-86b8-2ad77a8fadee","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"そうですね","ts":"1636460743.025800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JLGB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5820e3a0-6932-4b3c-b4c7-c94d437d7590","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"炒めるときの話ですか?","ts":"1636460448.025600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VUZmJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"304e8f31-c3bb-43f9-a9fc-c579c060cde4","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"キャベツって場所によって厚みにかなり差があるので、丁寧にやらないとムラできちゃいますね","ts":"1636459232.025400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mrFRs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8492D9C4-1E76-4D0D-8236-03CBFDD7EF8B","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"まぁ、戦ったのは己の欲望で、勝負には負けたんですけどね","ts":"1636386153.023600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"fuita","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","UD1FQV38V"]},{"name":"zabuton3","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0UiBP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"297C5557-F563-4F5E-8E21-C23B9C087145","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"戦利品です","ts":"1636386115.022700","files":[{"id":"F02LJRN1FDY","created":1636386106,"timestamp":1636386106,"name":"Image from iOS.jpg","title":"Image from iOS","mimetype":"image/jpeg","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"jpg","pretty_type":"JPEG","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":1856104,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02LJRN1FDY/image_from_ios.jpg","url_private_download":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02LJRN1FDY/download/image_from_ios.jpg","original_h":3024,"original_w":4032,"thumb_64":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F02LJRN1FDY-65bb6ced6b/image_from_ios_64.jpg","thumb_80":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V